Sun Oct 18 05:34:39 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to TSR 20240920 and daemon 20240916 (upstream ships
  them as separate artifacts now, replacing ethflop-20191003.zip
  with ethflop-20240920.zip and ethflopd-20240916-src.tar.gz):
  * TSR: phantom-drive check, drive-letter signaling to server,
    stack health check, configurable stack size, improved answer
    validation
  * Daemon: thin-provisioned large images, client mode, UDP
    control socket replacing the lock file, cached answer replay,
    DMF image support, syslog logging
  * Relicensed from ISC to MIT
- Drop the dos_tsr bcond: TSR sources are no longer in the release
  artifacts, the prebuilt ETHFLOP.COM is used (as before by default)

